Q: Grails 7.2.2 package/assemble fails with Snakeyaml &quot;LoaderOptions must be provided&quot; A: <p>The solution was to explicitly exclude Micronaut from the build:</p>
<pre><code>configurations.configureEach {
  exclude group: 'io.micronaut', module: 'micronaut-inject'
}
</code></pre>
<p>Micronaut is supposed to be absent from Grails 7.2.2. I happened to notice it was present in the dependencies anyway.  I can't explain this &quot;Micronaut creep&quot; because I carefully upgraded the app from scratch. Probably my mistake somewhere along the road. In this case Micronaut pulled some old versions of stuff into the build which made it fail. SnakeYaml was the victim, not the source of this problem.</p>

Q: In Laravel, the best way to pass different types of flash messages in the session A: <p>You can pass multiple flash sessions like</p>
<pre><code>return back()-&gt;with([
    'success' =&gt; 'Success Message Here.',
    'data' =&gt; [
        'action' =&gt; 'created',
        'custom' =&gt; $custom,
     ],
]);
</code></pre>

Q: Get Laravel 5 controller name in view A: <p>You can use this to just simply display in the title like &quot;Customer - My Site&quot; (laravel 9)</p>
<pre><code>{{ str_replace('Controller', '', strtok(substr(strrchr(request()-&gt;route()-&gt;getActionName(), '\\'), 1), '@'))}} - {{ config('app.name') }}
</code></pre>
